"title\":\"The Legend of the Condor Heroes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jH4UglJjh9pl9qNevoqofEHDGOs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4173913043478261,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":314540,\"title\":\"The Romance of Zero Chance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2joODMlNmV9oCaIOtqi8Zl5vTu7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4142857142857143,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":97276,\"title\":\"Under the Power\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s6gEzhGBG4MiWRbEOqHJzh6XG6X.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41250000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"A young woman makes a startling discovery about her longtime crush, while her star-crossed older sister welcomes an unexpected romance.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zvh9UCTETmqmZcgAMCUcqFGvjRg.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-04-14\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Two sisters, Xia Man Li and Xia Man An go to an anniversary party and a school reunion in search of their lost loves.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kOALzOoKO8flKXsy8vrRiNq6sZk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"After confessing her love for Ying Jie, Man An ends up as his chauffeur. Man Li gets drunk and embarrasses herself in front of Li Qi.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lLKuxL2YR4saecdPHIPO4CBzW0x.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-15\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Man Li reluctantly starts dating Li Qi. After Ying Qian makes the tabloids for his partying behavior, he agrees to be set up on a blind date by his mother.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lj55SzWDdndICzMPQdl4W6CiEjB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-16\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Xuan Xuan approaches Man An to teach her more about Ying Jie. Ying Qian's partying ruins a potential business deal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/icx5TVcuGVo1QEqfC5n8pfYXCwW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Man An intervenes and gets a major client to sign a contract with Ying Jie. Man Li and Li Qi find dating and maintaining their professional status at work difficult.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/FWzN711IIIrIc3hIwsZBPvWdtK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"The Xia family gets a visit from the oldest brother Man Wu. Man An gets offered a job, but is worried about her feelings for Ying Jie getting in the way.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hMnCzcq6oFZWZgeKef2allfFRLl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-21\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Man An's refusal of the job offer upsets her family and Ying Jie. Despite a valid excuse, when Ying Qian doesn't show up for his blind date, his father goes into a blind rage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3S6oUg4z9P3RBIkM92VxTVIeJYO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Man Li and Li Qi go on a date and share a kiss, but their coworkers have discovered their secret romance. After some convincing from the Chairman, Man An accepts the job offer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iz8d3lqt7ATfKhzPHhzNNLqsDXT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-23\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Man An starts her job, but it's Ying Jie who ends up lovesick with her at the company. Man Li's friends confront her about her relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mHHWzEwYXOFZ0wST1ZxZHmuSUut.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-24\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Ying Jie is exhausted and stressed out from work and his feelings for Man An. Auntie Ping forces Man Li to invite Li Qi to dinner.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/42LiCVuaKaIXqYUDEQZmH6dVhlA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"The family prepares for Li Qi's visit. Ying Jie has a big request for Xuan Xuan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cZCdNEAVj37zZzeS22bOlLMxGKN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-28\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Ying Jie breaks off the engagement with Xuan Xuan, and Man Li tries to declare her love for Li Qi before he goes on a business trip.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8UevR6MQPEloWeeLFYEkfq7NDxy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-29\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"With Xuan Xuan gone from the office, Man An tries to figure out who the other woman is. Ying Qian gets told off by a woman with a grudge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1XADnEMTjYUdRbXgQzeBElyjFkP.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-30\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"Ying Jie tries to keep his distance from Man An. Man Li gets into trouble while Li Qi is out of town.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/21V66x6Rt9h42PT0Otjqmm2KBsc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"After getting drunk the night before, Man Li wakes up with a strange man. Ying Jie's parents find out about the broken engagement.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pVAfbBQQj3ZG7bC2vrPJbcDtogo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-04\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"Li Qi returns from his trip and Man Li cannot bear to face him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3uioDTQ91eR6q6peWZ9LF1vrNwf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"Xuan Xuan figures out that Man An is the one Ying Jie loves. Ying Qian gets his blind date to give him another shot.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jJIPJLUkTQN82f1VmNcdLIujQbU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-06\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"Man Li finally comes clean to Li Qi, leaving him to think about it on his own. Ying Qing tries to make amends by having Sun over for lunch.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zuNEpFEejvdOzXKY08ntCbL4TwB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"Sun Yu Qing agrees to go on a date with Ying Qian. Despite confirming the engagement, Ying Jie tells Man An his true feelings.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rfYUpDZCzhjsMaIgY0zsIxNTNQv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-08\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"After revealing his feelings to Man An, Ying Jie decides to keep his family happy rather than start a relationship. But Xuan Xuan shows up to tell his parents the truth.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5nwFtxKq2QqJuG6roopn59Zm1Ho.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-11\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"Papa Xia is furious when he learns of Man An's feelings for Ying Jie. Ying Qian makes headway in his courtship with Yu Qing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jDgJsagvj3ZHG2HfZY6pDwrubpI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-12\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"Both families are in turmoil as the Chairman fires Papa Xia and Auntie Ping.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tUUHpMwd35gd8B8Lli2EKvIdJR6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"Everyone leaps into action as Ying Jie tries to run away from all his problems. Later he tells Man An his lifelong secret.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dxwgjjn98rFao5PdUXEY0aqk8ff.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"Man An comes up with a plan to test Ying Jie's devotion to his father, but the Chairman tries to bribe her to stay away!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y03ZRBVCf4P8QAqwnV2UFmIb30n.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-15\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"The Xia and Zheng families can't stay apart for very long. Man Li learns what really happened that night.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn8Ck5oG0ei6MbRyr6XOjj7PCBv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-18\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"Man Wu's proposal does not go as planned and Man An gets stood up.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tyygNPeOwoVQHUMlN2eEZZ5e53j.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 27\",\"overview\":\"When Ying Jie shows up to visit Man An in the country, her Granny puts him to work. The rest of the Xia family tries to figure out why Xin Ru didn't accept Man Wu's proposal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zUGHCJCExNCMsUX2K9N4AfkIGZ2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 28\",\"overview\":\"Man An's Granny tests if Ying Jie is worthy of Man An's love. Papa Xia gets a new job with a little help with a character from Man Li's past.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wSnf7W0O9pnLvnIJ8DbKmUtKqt8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-21\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 29\",\"overview\":\"After the truth about Ying Jie's parentage is out in the open, the Zheng family struggles to move forward.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o5Euc0rC31BQ0i2NjAJxdvXqryO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 30\",\"overview\":\"Ying Jie is on his own, his father fires him and he has to find a new job. Ying Qian and Man Li meet us to discuss his family and end up catching a criminal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/95Lc0NzHeIUUKMjkNPwyQ22ubkl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-25\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Episode 31\",\"overview\":\"When the Chairman has a heart attack, he finally tells Ying Jie how he really feels about him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qHdn4Rm2Ms5UzarORwBYeciU7an.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-26\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Episode 32\",\"overview\":\"After Papa Xia invites him over for a meal, He Shang De and Man Xi run into a conflict. Ying Jie presents Man An with love contract. Yu Qing tries to cut Ying Qian out her life, but ends up being too cruel.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8F4CRANChy5C0C3EOXYrKlRobfm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Episode 33\",\"overview\":\"Papa Xia enlists his family to help He Shang De. Man An and Ying Jie do all sorts of romantic things together, but it seems like Man Li's romance is in trouble.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fxYdStwUUWP3t4cRXB51QB99Exq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-28\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Episode 34\",\"overview\":\"Yu Qing and Ying Qian end up adopting a puppy. Ying Jie does battle with a claw machine to win a stuffed animal for Man An. Li Qi has been seen around a mysterious woman.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aXQ0bslRAbHXsdKhR4nq1uZwlQA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-29\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"Episode 35\",\"overview\":\"Man Wu quits his job to start his own business. When the Chairman gets out of the hospital, he meets with Man An.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qh8tcTtzNqwFJMcGQ4woStHUjSl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":36,\"name\":\"Episode 36\",\"overview\":\"The Deputy General Manager twists Li Qi's words and tries to drive a wedge between him and Man Li. Man An and Ying Jie go on their first official date.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPa0eISwlptP2bC1a1brEAbmOyS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-02\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":37,\"name\":\"Episode 37\",\"overview\":\"Man An and Ying Jie are permitted to get closer. The Deputy General Manager takes Le Er's promotion away and gives it to Man Li.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yestr7X6fac0WibWloP70cChWZB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-03\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":38,\"name\":\"Episode 38\",\"overview\":\"The Deputy General Manager causes more strife for Man Li and her coworkers. Man An is presumed drowned causing Ying Jie and her siblings to panic.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uMbdEwL7k8xV4WEFeN9vd1OvX2O.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-04\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":39,\"name\":\"Episode 39\",\"overview\":\"Xiang Ning causes more strife when City Mart stops doing business with He Shang De. Man Wu's business woes are revealed. And Ying Jie prepares to propose to Man Li.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wmVJ2OAqjHrQlQGSxrDhdgM64p2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":40,\"name\":\"Episode 40\",\"overview\":\"Man Wu and Xin Ru have a huge fight over money. Man An postpones her engagement in order to prove herself to Mr. Zheng.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qoKqPxzFI2ZwMTHJBvDMlBcrDY1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-08\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":41,\"name\":\"Episode 41\",\"overview\":\"As Man An tries to prove her worth, Madam and Cui Ping conspire to make Man An and Ying Jie declare an official engagement. Man Li tries to reconcile with Li Qi to repair Xiang Ning's damage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sH6suL0mT9kxpMLBY86uygkiRar.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-09\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":42,\"name\":\"Episode 42\",\"overview\":\"The families are thrilled and begin preparing for the engagement. When Man Li sees Xiang Ning kissing Li Qi, it's time to set some boundaries.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6cEfELNcW12lk6XUYppYl30pEHE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-10\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":43,\"name\":\"Episode 43\",\"overview\":\"When Ying Jie goes on a trip, Ying Qian leaves Man An in charge of his dog. Man Wu secretly continues to try to open his shop behind Xin Ru's back.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aG9ZbvbVdxaPgqfGp0p9xI7QTOb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-11\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":44,\"name\":\"Episode 44\",\"overview\":\"Man An goes in search of four-leaf clovers and the perfect wedding dress. While on a business trip, Li Qi and Xiang Ning get assaulted.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ziULyzgSJk5iaL0necJCIrvix5j.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-12\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":45,\"name\":\"Episode 45\",\"overview\":\"Man An's trip to find four-leaf clovers turns tragic when she gets injured and falls into a coma.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/212NJZHXpj73xeusOJjJhKohUw6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-15\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":46,\"name\":\"Episode 46\",\"overview\":\"Man An is up and out of her coma, but she has amnesia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t2tvKvHvKpw2R4Aj6foajDEiAUz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-16\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":47,\"name\":\"Episode 47\",\"overview\":\"Still without her memories, Man An returns home, but with a desire to move out. Xiang Ning persuades Li Qi to break up with Man Li.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qycbXE4fcMxgc7EeSVzCJ1k9Wp4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":48,\"name\":\"Episode 48\",\"overview\":\"Man An goes to site of her accident to regain her memories. He Shang De sees someone paying off Li Qi's attackers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aKqocO7c62MeXcl1Xcci5ei7EiG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-18\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":49,\"name\":\"Episode 49\",\"overview\":\"Shang De declares his love for Man Li. Man An worries about what will happen if she never regains the memories of her family and Ying Jie.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2BI0nSabgzvcCSoJYfIcJZ9AvWN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":50,\"name\":\"Episode 50\",\"overview\":\"Man Wu's lies have caught up with him and Xin Ru is nowhere to be found. Man An feels better after going to a support group.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rI2vGogT1k58BACFraGbukLiM8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":51,\"name\":\"Episode 51\",\"overview\":\"Xuan Xuan is confused when Man An says s