ts, Man Li comes closer to a decision on Li Qi and He Shang De.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Aftni6ZE3Sr86qDiOigu9fBfbR7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":58,\"name\":\"Episode 58\",\"overview\":\"Man Li cuts Li Qi off completely. Ying Qian's trickery works and Man An and Ying Jie declare their love for each other.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aIk8DKYd3hiAxkKaZp2HXoNEXT3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-02\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":59,\"name\":\"Episode 59\",\"overview\":\"Shang De and Man Li bond after he rescues her from the bus terminal and treats her sprained ankle.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/khQWiNHRaxtiuf3hD9WfakjbWci.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-03\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":60,\"name\":\"Episode 60\",\"overview\":\"Ying Jie's 'business trip' turns out to be a romantic getaway. Yu Qing takes Ying Qian out to cheer him up, but things go a little too far.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/inxASYwqp7DSGqg0wXRx5Ac1f94.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-06\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":61,\"name\":\"Episode 61\",\"overview\":\"After Man An accepts Ying Jie's proposal, the pressure's on for the rest of the couples to take the next step.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i9ERXCr0juLL9ixQuFMefxEy0uY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":62,\"name\":\"Episode 62\",\"overview\":\"Xiang Ning tell Man Li the real reason Li Qi broke up with her. Man An scrambles to repair a mistake she made at work.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ghakEPyudm6bf2Id2mwR2njD9fo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-08\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":63,\"name\":\"Episode 63\",\"overview\":\"Man Li tells Shang De and Li Qi she needs some time to decide who she wants to be with. Man An and Ying Qian ma